    <title>内网穿透</title>
    <url>/2024/07/24/respberry_pi/NAT_Traversal/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/hint.css/2.4.1/hint.min.css"><h2 id="内网穿透"><a href="#内网穿透" class="headerlink" title="内网穿透"></a>内网穿透</h2><p>内网穿透（Network Address Translation Traversal）是一种网络技术，用于在两个或多个位于不同网络内的主机间建立直接的通信连接，即使这些主机都被各自的NAT（网络地址转换）路由器所隔离。NAT路由器的主要功能是将私有IP地址转换为公共IP地址，以便在互联网上进行通信，同时保护内部网络不受外部直接访问。</p>
<p>例如我们在家庭中组件的局域网就是内网，相对内网我们日常使用的互联网就是外网，一般来说在没有固定公网IP的情况下，外网设备无法直接访问内网设备。而内网穿透技术，就是能让外网的设备找到处于内网的设备，从而实现数据通信。</p>
<h2 id="zerotier"><a href="#zerotier" class="headerlink" title="zerotier"></a>zerotier</h2><h3 id="在zerotier中创建网络"><a href="#在zerotier中创建网络" class="headerlink" title="在zerotier中创建网络"></a>在zerotier中创建网络</h3><ol>
<li><p><a class="link"   href="https://my.zerotier.com/" >点击这里 <i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-up-right-from-square fa-sm"></i></a>登录&#x2F;注册<code>zerotier</code></p>
</li>
<li><p><a id="createNetWork">创建网络</a></p>
<img  
                     lazyload
                     src="/images/loading.svg"
                     data-src="zerotier_create_network.png"
                      alt="image-20240724110528836" style="zoom:50%;" 
                ></li>
</ol>
<h3 id="树莓派中安装zerotier并加入网络"><a href="#树莓派中安装zerotier并加入网络" class="headerlink" title="树莓派中安装zerotier并加入网络"></a>树莓派中安装zerotier并加入网络</h3><ol>
<li><p>使用脚本安装</p>
<div class="highlight-container" data-rel="Shell"><figure class="iseeu highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">curl -s https://install.zerotier.com | sudo bash</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div>
</li>
<li><p>使用<code>systemctl</code>管理<code>zerotier</code></p>
<div class="highlight-container" data-rel="Shell"><figure class="iseeu highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">启动</span></span><br><span class="line">sudo systemctl start zerotier-one</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">停止</span></span><br><span class="line">sudo systemctl stop zerotier-one</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">重启</span></span><br><span class="line">sudo systemctl restart zerotier-one</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">查看状态</span></span><br><span class="line">sudo systemctl status zerotier-one</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div>
</li>
<li><p>设置成开机自启动</p>
<div class="highlight-container" data-rel="Shell"><figure class="iseeu highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">sudo systemctl enable zerotier-one</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div>
</li>
<li><p>将<code>zerotier</code>加入到网络中</p>
<div class="highlight-container" data-rel="Shell"><figure class="iseeu highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">加入网络</span></span><br><span class="line">sudo zerotier-cli join NETWORK_ID</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">查看已加入网络</span></span><br><span class="line">sudo zerotier-cli listnetworks</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div>

<p>其中<code>NETWORK_ID</code>为<a href="#createNetWork">创建网络</a>步骤中已创建网络的<code>NETWORK ID</code></p>
</li>
<li><p>首次加入网络后登录<code>zerotier</code>对新设备进行认证</p>
<img  
                     lazyload
                     src="/images/loading.svg"
                     data-src="auth_new_client.png"
                      alt="认证" style="zoom:50%;" 
                ></li>
</ol>
<h3 id="参见"><a href="#参见" class="headerlink" title="参见"></a>参见</h3><h2 id="natapp"><a href="#natapp" class="headerlink" title="natapp"></a>natapp</h2><h3 id="创建隧道"><a href="#创建隧道" class="headerlink" title="创建隧道"></a>创建隧道</h3><ol>
<li><p><a class="link"   href="https://natapp.cn/login" >点击这里 <i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-up-right-from-square fa-sm"></i></a>登录&#x2F;注册<code>natapp</code></p>
</li>
<li><p>购买隧道</p>
<img  
                     lazyload
                     src="/images/loading.svg"
                     data-src="buy_tunnel.png"
                      alt="image-20240724113055777" style="zoom:50%;" 
                >
</li>
<li><p>点击已购买的隧道, 查看authtoken</p>
<img  
                     lazyload
                     src="/images/loading.svg"
                     data-src="copy_auth.png"
                      alt="image-20240724113510300" style="zoom:50%;" 
                ></li>
</ol>
<h3 id="树莓派中安装natapp"><a href="#树莓派中安装natapp" class="headerlink" title="树莓派中安装natapp"></a>树莓派中安装natapp</h3><ol>
<li><p><a class="link"   href="https://natapp.cn/#download" >点击这里 <i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-up-right-from-square fa-sm"></i></a>下载树莓派使用的客户端, 放在目录 <code>/usr/natapp/</code> 运行</p>
<div class="highlight-container" data-rel="Shell"><figure class="iseeu highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">利用curl在树莓派上直接下载natapp, 也可手动下载后上传</span></span><br><span class="line">sudo curl https://download.natapp.cn/assets/downloads/clients/2_4_0/natapp_linux_arm/natapp -o natapp</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">赋运行权限</span></span><br><span class="line">sudo chmod a+x /usr/natapp/natapp</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div>
</li>
<li><p>下载<code>config.ini</code>放置在同级目录,config 配置说明请见 <a class="link"   href="https://natapp.cn/article/config_ini" >https://natapp.cn/article/config_ini <i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-up-right-from-square fa-sm"></i></a></p>
<p>将authtoken等配置 写入 config.ini中.需要注意的是 务必关闭 关闭Web管理界面 (登录网站-&gt;我的隧道-&gt;配置)</p>
</li>
<li><p>测试运行情况</p>
<div class="highlight-container" data-rel="Shell"><figure class="iseeu highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">./usr/natapp/natapp</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div>
</li>
<li><p><a class="link"   href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/natapp/natapp_autostart/master/RaspberryPi/natapp" >下载 <i class="fa-regular fa-arrow-up-right-from-square fa-sm"></i></a>自启动脚本并放在<code>/etc/init.d/</code> 下</p>
</li>
<li><p>赋于自启动脚本权限并测试启动</p>
<div class="highlight-container" data-rel="Shell"><figure class="iseeu highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">sudo chmod 755 /etc/init.d/natapp</span><br><span class="line">sudo /etc/init.d/natapp start</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div>
</li>
<li><p>加入开机自启动</p>
<div class="highlight-container" data-rel="Shell"><figure class="iseeu highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cd /etc/init.d</span><br><span class="line">sudo update-rc.d natapp defaults 90</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div>
</li>
<li><p>重启</p>
<div class="highlight-container" data-rel="Shell"><figure class="iseeu highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">sudo reboot</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div></li>
</ol>
<h3 id="参见-1"><a href="#参见-1" class="headerlink" title="参见"></a>参见</h3>]]></content>
